OL,3,GNEWSA'Difficult decision' to close
OL,4,ASamaritans branch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision to close a branch of a
OL,7,Fsuicide prevention charity in West
OL,8,FSussex is about building a "more
OL,9,Fsustainable service for the future",
OL,10,Fthe charity has said.
OL,12,FSamaritans has confirmed the "difficult
OL,13,Fdecision" to shut its Worthing branch
OL,14,Fat the end of November, leaving the
OL,15,Fnearest branch in Brighton, around 30
OL,16,Fminutes away.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32902
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1792752960
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Difficult decision' to close
OL,4,ASamaritans branch
OL,5,
OL,6,FVanessa Hamilton, assistant director of
OL,7,Fservice delivery (South), said: "Over
OL,8,Fthe next decade, we are moving to
OL,9,Ffewer, larger branches across the UK
OL,10,Fand while we deeply value our
OL,11,Fvolunteers, our ultimate duty is to
OL,12,Fservice-users."
OL,14,FWorthing branch volunteer Jim Pollard
OL,15,Fbelieves this is the "worst time to be
OL,16,Fclosing branches of Samaritans".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
